Template: mymate-agent/url
Type: string
Description: My Mate server URL:
 The address of the central My Mate server this agent connects out to, for
 example https://mymate.example.com. http(s):// is rewritten to ws(s):// and
 /agent is appended automatically.

Template: mymate-agent/token
Type: password
Description: My Mate agent token:
 The bearer token that identifies this agent to the server. Create one on the
 server with:  php artisan mymate:agent:create "Site name"

Template: mymate-agent/no-config
Type: note
Description: My Mate agent not configured
 No server URL or token was provided, so the agent has been installed but not
 started. Set them later with:  sudo dpkg-reconfigure mymate-agent
